tion to Smart homes\n\nSmartly designed  2 bed residences by Veena developers at Kandivali west,East west facing vastu compliant apartments with scenic view of greenary nature.\n\nIt has many lifestyle amenities such as roof top zen garden,yoga,gymnasium,indoor games,buddha sclupture lawn, reflexology path,swing for adults,pergola seating & much more.\n\nThis project also offers great connectivity\n\nMetro station-5mins\n\noscar hospital-7mins\n\nbusiness hubs,school & college within 5mins\n\nEntertainment & shopping avenues within 10mins\n\nConstruction work is  in full swing Possession\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05052c6e003-72578577.jpg)CCTV\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183d4b061115-66519813.jpg)Conference room\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183c02c3bac4-84599175.jpg)Elevator\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05077e9b612-72077823.jpg)Garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a9700faa70-06352851.jpg)Grand lobby\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05040b0b828-36177329.jpg)Gymnasium\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05082c0a6c5-03311143.jpg)Indoor Games\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a71270bdd6-61887784.jpg)Jogging track\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0523d3ca665-43164855.jpg)Kids Play Area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2023/05/30/6475a7a3cc9a22-58132129.jpg)Multipurpose Hall\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/16/632441c5d2f710-38234372.jpg)Reflexology Path\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a78f420df1-47241807.jpg)Rooftop garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/6310779b4752a9-36414246.jpg)Security\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315aafc3a2db1-08158002.jpg)Senior citizen area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/08/25/63076704121bd4-42236428.jpg)yoga deck\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[2 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 2 BHK | 590.00 Sq.ft | 1.30 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2022/12/08/60793233df14c07da6d2339b18f0db84.pdf) |\n\n[#### Location](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[#### Veena Developers](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/developer/logo/2022/10/26/6358d9e7cfb184-09718247.jpg)\n\n* Established In1991\n* Total Projects\n\nWith an extensive experience of more than 31 years in the Real Estate Sector, our group of talented and dynamic real estate professionals work tirelessly to deliver projects on time with efficiency. Veena Developers have been pioneering the league of providing Housing and Corporate Spaces by offering world-class amenities to the customers. Be it building high rise luxury housing spaces or building Corporate spaces, we put our heart and soul into the development of the project and make sure that it surpasses the expectations of the clients. We constantly focus on building long-term client relationships through coordinated efforts formed on transparency and mutual trust. Veena Developers has landmarks across Mumbai and Mumbai Metropolitan Areas of exceptional quality, each surpassing the other. As we grow, we will remain committed to the principles that have served our company and clients well over the years. We prioritize our Client's interest and well-being.\n\n[#### More Projects by Veena Deve