sofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.49 Cr to 1.54 Cr\\*\n\n![Veena Smart Homes](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/68911/1657615216_veena-smart-homes-elevation-129857096.jpeg \"Veena Smart Homes\")\n\n# Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Veena Smart Homes](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/68911/1657615216_veena-smart-homes-elevation-129857096.jpeg \"Veena Smart Homes\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 571 sqft - 590 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 148 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 1.42 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2025\n* Rera: P51800032966\n\n## About\n\nVeena Smart Homes is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Kandivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 1.42 Acres, the project features 148 Units in 1 Towers, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments, Plots ranging from 571 sqft to 590 sqft. The address for the project is kandivali west, western suburbs, mumbai.\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments, Plots at Veena Smart Homes are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 571 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments, Plots go up to 590 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments, Plots at Veena Smart Homes are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 1.49 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments, Plots from 1.54 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Veena Developers, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800032966 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2025-12-16, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nVeena Smart Homes is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 1.42 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 148 Units, 1 Towers\n* Sizes: 571 sqft to 590 sqft\n* Project Address: kandivali west, western suburbs, mumbai\n* Type: Residential Apartments, Plots\n* Developer: Veena Developers\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800032966 Units\n* Possession Start: 2025-12-16\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nVeena Smart Homes benefits from its location in Kandivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Veena Smart Homes will begin in 2025-12-16, and the project is RERA registered under P51800032966 Units. Developed by Veena Developers, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Veena Smart Homes\n