p](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800002804RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Veena Signature\n\nby [Veena Developers](/builder/veena-developers)\n\n📍 Borivali, Mumbai Suburban · 400092\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-current-status-.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-current-status--1-.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-elevation-image-00.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-elevation-image-1.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-elevation-image-2.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-image.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-garden.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-kids-corner.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-badminton-court.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-view-from-veena-signature.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-site-layout-plan.webp)![Veena Signature ](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/5183/5183-oth-veena-signature-typical-floor-plan.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\n## 3BHK Flats in Kandivali (W), Veena Signature, Ready to Move In, OC Received.\n\nSignature by Veena Developers is an emblem of extravagance. Reigning as the crowning glory of Kandivali, the building stands tall and proud with its premium facilities. The Signature project is a commercial cum residential project which is substantially built for the elite. Tastefully crafted, every floors holds 2 units of spacious 3 BHK flats in Kandivali west. It overlooks to a breathtaking view of MCA Sports Club / Sachin Tendulkar Sports Club , thereby ensuring so structures to obstruct your view of greenery. A signature as prominent as such, leaves a mark in the minds of the peers.\n\n**Hallmarks of Veena Signature:**\n\n* Ground + 1 Commercial Level + 13 Upper Residential Floors.\n* Location is Mahavir Nagar,Near Veena Sarang, **Kandivali West** and is developed by **Veena Developers.**\n* **Veena Signature is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51800002804.**\n* **Veena Signature was launched in Dec 2012 & Delivered by Jan 2018**\n* 2 Apartments Per Floor\n* Veena Signature offers 3 BHK-1041 Sq.ft. Carpet.\n* Lifetime Unobstructed Open View.\n* Vastu Compliant Apartments\n* Optimum Space Utilization with Cross Ventilated Design For Natural Sunlight.\n* Separate Utility Area attached to Kitchen\n* Top-Of-Line Security Features\n* Grand Entrance Lobby\n* **Veena Signature has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5.**\n\nVeena Developers also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Veena Saaz, Veena Santur, Veena Velocity, Veena Sky Heights, Veena Signature, Veena Sahil Villa, Veena Symphony, Veena Laya, Veena Santoor 2, Veena Dynasty, Veena Crest, Veena Serenity, Royale Villa, Veena Dynasty, Veena Velocity.   \n  \n**The property prices in Kandivali West** are in the range of 13000 to 17500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.  \n  \n Veena Developers currently has 5 Ready Possession projects.\n\n**You can download the brochure of Veena Signature** and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website. The Bookings for the Ready Possession project Veena Signature are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.  \n Veena Signature is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹35,096\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n12% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹35,096/sqft** — **38% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2019\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2019\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n3 BHK1,041–